      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Background images, including front and back cover images, can be sized relative to the page using the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "fit"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute on the image macro. The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "fit"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute works similarly to the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "object-fit"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " property in CSS. Its value must be specified as a single keyword, chosen from the table below. The starting size of the image is determined by the explicit width, if specified, or the implicit width. The height is always derived from the width while respecting the implicit aspect ratio of the image. The available space—​the canvas—​for a background image is the page. If the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "fit"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute is not specified, it defaults to "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "contain"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "contain"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " value automatically scales the image to fit the bounds of the page."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
