                "value": "In addition to scaling, background images for cover pages, content pages, and the title page support positioning using the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "position"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute on the image macro. The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "position"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute accepts a syntax similar to the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "background-position"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " property in CSS, except only the keyword positions are supported. The position consists of two values, the vertical position and the horizontal position (e.g., "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "top center"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "). If only one value is specified (e.g., "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "top"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "), the other value is assumed to be "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "center"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". If the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "position"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute is not specified, its value defaults to is "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "center center"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". The "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "center center"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " value centers the image vertically and horizontally on the page."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The following table lists of the vertical and horizontal positioning keywords the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "position"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute supports. You can use any combination of these keywords to position the image."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
